---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Intro from '../components/Intro.astro';
import { company } from '../data/company';
---

<Layout title="Privacy & data use"
  ><Intro
    eyebrow="PRIVATE REVIEW"
    title="Privacy & data use."
    description="This notice describes the private website review and its demo inquiry form."
  /><section class="section">
    <div class="wrap article">
      <p class="notice">
        Review-stage notice · 27 September 2026. Live inquiry delivery is
        disabled.
      </p><h2>Your inquiry information</h2><p>
        The demo form lets you test an inquiry using sample details. Form
        entries remain in the page’s memory and are not sent to Monir Group,
        stored in a database, saved in browser storage or emailed. Reloading or
        closing the page clears entered contact details.
      </p><p>
        The selected product is included in the page URL so a product inquiry
        can be opened directly. Do not put personal or confidential information
        in the product field or share URLs that contain it.
      </p><h2>Hosting and access</h2><p>
        This private preview is hosted through OpenAI Sites on Cloudflare
        infrastructure. Access and ordinary hosting logs may be processed by
        those providers under their respective terms. The local development
        preview runs on the reviewer’s computer.
      </p><h2>Measurement and external links</h2><p>
        No advertising, tracking cookies or third-party analytics service has
        been added to this website. Interaction events are available within the
        page for future integration; they are not transmitted to an analytics
        provider. Maps, phone and email links open the relevant external service
        or application, whose own privacy practices apply.
      </p><h2>Contacting the group directly</h2><p>
        If you send an email or call, you share your details directly with the
        recipient and your communication provider. For questions about
        information shared directly with the group, contact <a
          href={`mailto:${company.email.value}`}>{company.email.value}</a
        >.
      </p><h2>Before live inquiries are enabled</h2><p>
        The group must confirm the responsible business entity, inquiry
        recipient, delivery provider, purpose of processing, retention period,
        deletion process and applicable privacy requirements. This notice will
        need to be updated to reflect those choices before a public launch.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section></Layout
>
